# Copy Rules

- Operator console is **English only** — no locale switching or Bengali catalog.
- Keep user-facing text in `~/copy/index.ts` (or domain helpers in `~/copy/`).
- Do not leave placeholder strings in production routes.
- Form field markers use `~/copy/labels.ts` (`optionalLabel`, `requiredForReviewLabel`).
